<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_fiber_module_loader">FiberModuleLoader</link></para>

<para>Manages true asynchronous module loading using PHP 8.1+ Fibers. Fibers provide lightweight pseudo-threading without race conditions.</para>

<para>Works with PHP 8.1+. Falls back gracefully if Fibers unavailable. </para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8fibermoduleloader_8php_source_1l00017">17</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8fibermoduleloader_8php_source">class.fibermoduleloader.php</link>.</para>
</section>
